{"key":"moment:3706442","id":"3706442","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1696395696804,"text":"前几天看坚如磐石，看见一个重庆演员，很亲切，但忘了他在山城棒棒军里演的角色叫什么了（都是超级小时候的记忆了）。结果昨晚做梦梦到这个演员，笑嘻嘻地跟我说他演的角色叫“毛子”，醒来一查，还真是。\n潜意识里的记忆，很神奇吧？[emot=acfun,1874/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":66,"likeCount":234,"bananaCount":146,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/3706442","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":59,"archivedRoots":36,"commentPages":["comments/3706442/all/1.json","comments/3706442/all/2.json"],"hotPages":["comments/3706442/hot/1.json"],"threads":{"793652974":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793652974/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793652974","root":"793652974","user":{"id":"848057","name":"落地砍bear","avatar":"5181e1b4593c80621c0f1e60"},"text":"山城棒棒军，确实是有点遥远的记忆了","time":1696400593917,"floor":28,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"793652944":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793652944/1.json"],"savedReplies":4,"reportedReplies":4,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793652944","root":"793652944","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]说起来，昨晚我也做了个很离奇的梦。\n我和另一个肥肥出门谈业务回来，魂宝（对，就是茗魂，虽然没见过面，但梦里就是默认是她，不知为什么，很怪。总之设定就是这样）对肥肥说，你们又说错话了，居然说直岗山是杭州的。我很气，说我没说啊，直岗山不是安徽的吗！魂宝于是对肥肥说，说对了。你看！（意思是我是对的，他说错了）\n醒来后，我总觉得有哪里不对，一查，\nTMD根本没有直岗山这座山！[emot=acfun,1820/][/color]","time":1696400536513,"floor":27,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":true}},"793652685":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793652685/1.json"],"savedReplies":13,"reportedReplies":13,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793652685","root":"793652685","user":{"id":"23682490","name":"AC娘本体","avatar":"5644cb55cccd388bc266ef09"},"text":"我叫美女","time":1696399685362,"floor":25,"likes":100,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":13,"hot":true}},"793652178":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793652178/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793652178","root":"793652178","user":{"id":"509669","name":"mixin14","avatar":"33cdfc7d7ad151d7fd646ecf"},"text":"经常会有这种情况的，昨天我忘记洗锅了，昨晚睡觉梦里告诉我锅没洗，早上起来一看，真没洗锅！[emot=acfun,1756/]","time":1696398218042,"floor":17,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"793651990":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793651990/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793651990","root":"793651990","user":{"id":"55513717","name":"森崎唱歌好好听","avatar":"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3"},"text":"你好，我是你的大脑，那天你没记起那个名字，也许你没当回事，我却暗暗记在心里。终于，花了几天功夫，我终于知道了那个名字，赶快托梦告诉了你，你说我是不是很棒？","time":1696397663364,"floor":13,"likes":34,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":true}},"793651642":{"pages":["comments/3706442/threads/793651642/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"793651642","root":"793651642","user":{"id":"1050329","name":"这么多的发","avatar":"ca133b9319538ca94b0ae71c"},"text":"暴露年龄了水姐","time":1696396462788,"floor":8,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}}},"hotCount":3}